B 0x7003 THE MUSIC CHANGES WITH THE DISTANCE TRAVELLED
B 0x7003 The music of each stage is not launched once: there is a list per stage
B 0x7003 (the table at 0x7056 says which one) with pairs [distance][what plays],
B 0x7003 and every frame it looks in it for the range the distance travelled falls
B 0x7003 in. If what comes out is different from what is already playing
B 0x7003 (0xE012), the change is noted.
