C 0x7024 The distance travelled
C 0x7027 Each row: two bytes of distance and one of music
C 0x702D DCOMPR: the range is looked for
C 0x7034 If it is the one already playing, nothing is touched
C 0x7039 And if not, it is noted in 0xE113
