B 0x7216 THE COLLISIONS BETWEEN THE SHIP'S SHOTS AND THE ENEMIES
B 0x7216 Every frame the two lists are crossed: for each live enemy whose bit 1
B 0x7216 of byte 27 is set, the ship's NINE shots are walked (0xE260, records of
B 0x7216 0x10 bytes) to see whether any of them falls inside its box. The box is
B 0x7216 not square: 0x12 wide by 0x20 high, and the type 3 shot (the laser) is
B 0x7216 measured another way, with the height taken from its own record times
B 0x7216 eight.
